{"id": "16-1067-2-2", "zh": "以 bha 结尾的词根", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1068-2-4", "zh": "bhā：照耀义。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1068-5-11", "zh": "如：月亮照耀（cando bhāti）；问题浮现在我心中（pañhā maṃ paṭibhāti）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1068-12-14", "zh": "夜晚破晓（ratti vibhāti）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1068-15-18", "zh": "bhāṇu（太阳）、paṭibhānaṃ（辩才）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1068-19-21", "zh": "vibhātā ratti（已经破晓的夜晚）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1069-2-4", "zh": "bhī：恐惧义。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1069-5-6", "zh": "bhāyati（害怕）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1069-7-20", "zh": "bhayaṃ（恐惧）、bhayānako（可怕的）、bhīmo（可畏的）、bhīmaseno（怖军，人名）、bhīru（胆怯者）、bhīruko（胆小的）、bhīrukajātiko（生性胆小的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1069-21-35", "zh": "使役形有“bhāyeti、bhāyayati、bhāyāpeti、bhāyāpayati”这些词形。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1070-2-5", "zh": "sabhu、sambhu：伤害义。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1070-6-7", "zh": "sabhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1070-8-9", "zh": "sambhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1071-2-5", "zh": "sumbha：言说义，以及（伤害义）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1071-6-9", "zh": "这里的 ca（以及）字是兼指伤害义的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1071-10-11", "zh": "sumbhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1071-12-13", "zh": "sumbho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1071-14-15", "zh": "kusumbho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1072-2-6", "zh": "这里，**sumbho** 是指坑穴。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1072-7-16", "zh": "“挖一个坑吧”就是这里的例证。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1072-17-31", "zh": "**kusumbho** 是指小坑，“（雨水）灌满了山洞、岩缝和溪流，又把小坑一一注满”就是这里的例证。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1073-2-6", "zh": "abbha、vabbha、mabbha：行走义。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1073-7-8", "zh": "abbhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1073-9-10", "zh": "abbho（云）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1073-11-12", "zh": "vabbhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1073-13-14", "zh": "mabbhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1074-2-6", "zh": "这里，**abbho** 是指云。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1074-7-20", "zh": "因为它聚成成百上千层而移动（abbhati），所以称为“abbho”。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1074-21-29", "zh": "经中说：“以闪电为花鬘、层叠百重的（云）”。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-1074-30-34", "zh": "**satakkakū** 的意思是有成百上千层的。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1074-35-41", "zh": "此外，这里的 abbha 一词应当理解为三种词性都有。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1074-42-61", "zh": "例如在“他像升起的云一样离去，一去就不再回头”中，它是阳性。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-1074-62-78", "zh": "在“云、雾、烟、尘、罗睺”中，它是阴性。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1074-79-89", "zh": "在“云层遮住了月轮”中，它是中性。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1075-2-6", "zh": "以下是云的各种名称：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1076-2-9", "zh": "megho、valāhako、laṅghi、jīmūto、ambudo、ghano；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1077-2-7", "zh": "dhārādharo、ambudharo、pajjunno、himagabbhako。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1078-2-4", "zh": "yabha：交合义。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1078-5-16", "zh": "一对男女（mithuna）这两个人的这种行为叫作 methuna（交合）；yabha 这个词根就用于这种交合义。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1078-17-18", "zh": "yabhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1078-19-20", "zh": "yābhassaṃ。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1079-2-16", "zh": "这里，“methuna”是雅正的说法，因为它是有羞耻心的人也可以说出口的语言。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1079-17-50", "zh": "例如“不应从事交合之法”，以及“国王不是我的朋友，国王也不是我的盟友”，这种说法都出现在文雅的言语场合中。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1079-51-68", "zh": "而“yabhati”等说法，就像“sikharaṇī”等说法一样，是不雅的言辞。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1079-69-76", "zh": "因为即使是具有惭愧心的世俗之人，也不会说这样的话。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1079-77-86", "zh": "尽管如此，拥有至高惭愧的世尊，内心受大悲所驱动，出于对世间的怜悯，仍然在大众当中说了这样的话。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1079-87-90", "zh": "如来的大悲是多么深广啊！", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1080-2-6", "zh": "以下是交合之法的各种名称：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1081-2-8", "zh": "saṃvesanaṃ、niddhuvanaṃ、methunaṃ、sūrataṃ、rataṃ；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1082-2-9", "zh": "byathayo、gāmadhammo（村俗之法）、yābhassaṃ、mohanaṃ、rati；", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1083-2-7", "zh": "asaddhammo（非正法）、vasaladhammo（贱民之法），还有 mīḷhasukhaṃ（秽乐）；", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1084-2-8", "zh": "dvayaṃdvayasamāpatti（两两相合）、dvando、gammo、udakantiko。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1085-2-5", "zh": "sibha、vibha：夸耀义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1085-6-7", "zh": "sibhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1085-8-9", "zh": "vibhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1086-2-7", "zh": "debha、abhi、dabhi：发声义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1086-8-9", "zh": "debhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1086-10-11", "zh": "ambhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1086-12-13", "zh": "ambho（水）。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1086-14-15", "zh": "dambhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1087-2-7", "zh": "这里，ambho 是指水。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1087-8-19", "zh": "因为水虽然没有生命，但在洪水泛滥等时候奔流而下，会发出声响（ambhati），所以称为**ambho**。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1088-2-4", "zh": "以下是水的各种名称：", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1089-2-11", "zh": "pānīyaṃ、udakaṃ、toyaṃ、jalaṃ、pāto 与 ambu；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1090-2-11", "zh": "dakaṃ、kaṃ、salilaṃ、vāri、āpo、ambho 以及 papaṃ；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1091-2-9", "zh": "nīraṃ、kepukaṃ、pāni、amataṃ 以及 elaṃ，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1092-2-8", "zh": "这些都是水的名称，出自各处文献。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1093-2-9", "zh": "这里，“……以及在毛尖的水珠里。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1093-10-20", "zh": "他们也大量饮水”等用例，应当举出来作为例证。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "16-1094-2-8", "zh": "thabhi、khabhi：阻碍义，如 thambhati、vitthambhati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1094-9-12", "zh": "khambhati、vikkhambhati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1094-13-14", "zh": "thambho（柱子）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1094-15-18", "zh": "thaddho（僵硬的）、upatthambho（支撑）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1094-19-20", "zh": "upatthambhinī（支撑者，阴性）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1094-21-22", "zh": "vikkhambho（镇伏）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1094-23-24", "zh": "vikkhambhitakileso（已镇伏烦恼的人）。", "confidence": 80}
